{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sinopse</h2>&quot;Stages of Life&quot; is an <strong>exciting puzzle game</strong> that follows the life of a girl, showing <strong>moments from her childhood to her adult life.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322170/extras/menu2.gif?t=1717081276\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience:</h2><br>Each level offers a new opportunity for <strong>reflection and learning</strong>, allowing the player to jointly <strong>experience the girl's moments</strong> in an authentic and empathetic way.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322170/extras/complet.gif?t=1717081276\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><br>The game has <strong>6 different scenarios</strong>, which the girl goes through during her timeline. The player will be able to select to assemble in the order they wish, in addition to being able to <strong>choose one of the different sizes</strong> available to assemble and <strong>choose the background color</strong> of their preference.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322170/extras/color2.gif?t=1717081276\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Graphics and Music:</h2><br>With colorful <strong>graphics and an inspiring soundtrack</strong>, \u201cStages of Life\u201d is an engaging game that seeks to be <strong>casual and relaxing</strong>, ensuring that the player can complete challenges in a calm and enjoyable way.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322170/extras/puzzle.gif?t=1717081276\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Objectives:</h2><br>The ultimate goal is to bring a <strong>relaxing environment to players</strong>, so they can forget about the stressful activities in life, as well as make them feel <strong>moved and inspired</strong> by the girl's story an